				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Innumera me circumstant negocia; quare, reverende <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>in Christo pater, me excusatum habere velis.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Christi negocium haeret; procedere enim id dicere <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>non ausim, cum in dies videam, quae nolim.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Novus pontifex dicitur insolitę esse liberalitatis <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>erga suos omnes; sunt, qui affirment <placeName ref="l522">Venetos</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>ab eo insigni munere affectos.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><persName>Hannibalem</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>nepotem ex sorore, <foreign xml:lang="de">zuͦ <placeName ref="l3005">Under-Ems</placeName> gesäßen,</foreign> hominem, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ut dicunt, quibus notus est, ferocem, ad summam <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>dignitatem dicitur evexisse.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="de">Mit im ist ynhin <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>geritten <persName>Dietägen Saliß</persName>, römischer <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>landtvogt in Gerichten; dan des paapst bruͦder, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>der castellan von <placeName>Müß</placeName>, sol by des <persName>Dietägen</persName> vatter <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>gedienet han in <placeName ref="l37">Pergäl</placeName> und syn rytbuͦb gesyn sin; <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>der paapst aber sol disen <persName>Dietägen</persName> naachmalen <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>uß dem touff gehept han.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Ipse est viduus, sperat <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>sacerdotium.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Ita nos sumus in medio.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Deus <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ecclesię suae praesto sit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Mitto nova, quae d. <persName ref="p8362">Guarnerius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>et ipse attulit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de">Remitte schedam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Plura nunc <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>non possum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, pater reverende.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/><placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName> 5. februarii anno 1560.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/><persName ref="p8009">Ioannes Fabricius</persName>, tui observantissimus.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Si quid certi apud vos est de <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>persequutione <placeName>Gallica</placeName> aut <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>si <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>quid exiit maxime German<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>ice, quęso, ad nos <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>mittite.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro eruditione <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>et pietate excellenti d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullingero</persName>, ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z4"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> antistiti <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>vigilantissimo, domino <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>et patrono <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>suo multum <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>honorando.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>